      "a": "<p>det(A − λI) = λ² − 7λ + 10 = (λ−5)(λ−2), so λ = 5, 2.</p>\n<p>λ = 5: −x + y = 0 gives (1,1). λ = 2: 2x + y = 0 gives (1,−2). Check A(1,1) = (5,5) ✓.</p>",
