      "a": "<p>Action record:</p>\n<pre class=\"code\"><code>Decisions\n1. Module 3 retained but made optional.   (corrected from \"drop\")\nActions\n1. Anil  - revised syllabus        - Monday\n2. ?     - speak to exam cell      - owner not stated\n3. All   - lab slots query         - deadline not stated</code></pre>\n<p>Unstated: who contacts the exam cell, and by when; also whether the optional module affects assessment. A weak note-taker would (i) record \"module 3 dropped\" — the self-correction \"no, keep it but make it optional\" reverses it — and (ii) write \"someone will talk to the exam cell\", which is not an action item because it has no owner.</p>",
