      "a": "<p><em>Hook:</em> \"Right now four of you in this room have a folder called <code>final<sub>final v2</sub></code>. That folder is why you need Git.\" <em>Connect:</em> \"Every group project this semester will lose work at least once, and it is entirely preventable.\" <em>Purpose:</em> \"In five minutes I'll show you the three commands that cover ninety per cent of what you'll ever need.\" <em>Roadmap:</em> \"First what version control actually does; then the three commands; then how not to break your teammate's work.\" <strong>Key step:</strong> the roadmap names the three points in order, in one breath, before you start point one.</p>",
