     "title": "Overview",
     "html": "<div class=\"tbl-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Unit</th><th>Focus</th><th>What you can do by the end</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>Kanji &amp; Vocabulary</td><td>Read and write about 80 basic Kanji; use essential everyday vocabulary</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>Core Grammar</td><td>Build sentences, conjugate verbs, use adjectives, particles and the て-form</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>Expressing Yourself</td><td>Talk about daily life, preferences, abilities, experiences, invitations, suggestions and opinions</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>The Four Skills</td><td>Read, listen, speak and write on familiar topics at JLPT N5 level</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p><strong>Target level:</strong> JLPT N5</p>\n<div class=\"divider\"></div>"
